  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5301.25 \"Refresher course\" means a mandatory, annual course which all instructors must complete in order to maintain their status as an instructor. The definition also includes the term “spring update”.\n\nSource. #8403, eff 8-2-05; ss by #10589, eff 5-14-14; ss by #14174, eff 1-17-25 (formerly Saf-C 5301.24)",
